"application_response_count + mapping_error_count). Should always be 0 - a "
"non-zero value means some documents reported by DIAN were lost somewhere in "
"the pipeline without being counted, and is a good candidate for an automated"
" alert."
msgstr ""
"dian_records_filtered menos (document_count + already_in_system_count + "
"application_response_count + mapping_error_count). Siempre debería ser 0: un"
" valor distinto de cero significa que algunos documentos reportados por la "
"DIAN se perdieron en algún punto del proceso sin ser contabilizados, y es un"
" buen candidato para una alerta automática."
